abstract: >-
  AISKG Framework unifies literature retrieval, preprocessing, semantic modelling,
  ontology-guided extraction, graph construction, pathway analysis, validation,
  benchmarking, research-representation analysis, robustness testing, and
  deterministic release auditing for biomedical literature mining.
